# No client-side environment variables are required by the current application.
#
# Never expose Deepslate credentials to the browser. Secrets must not use the
# VITE_ prefix, because Vite inlines VITE_* values into the client bundle.
#
# Planned server-side configuration (not implemented in this stage):
#   DEEPSLATE_API_KEY
#   DEEPSLATE_VENDOR_ID
#   DEEPSLATE_ORGANIZATION_ID
#   DEEPSLATE_MODEL_ID
#   RELAY_SESSION_SECRET
#
# Those values will belong in a server-side secret store (for example Wrangler
# secrets or .dev.vars, which is git-ignored), never in this template.
